{"id":"b7050f6732cc53d7","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-solovay-lem2.md","title":"Solovay Counter-Realization","display":"lem-solovay-lem2 — Solovay Counter-Realization","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-solovay-lem2","aliases":["89-lem-solovay-lem2"],"display":"lem-solovay-lem2 — Solovay Counter-Realization","depends_on":["[[89-lem-solovay-truth]]","[[89-df-generated-submodel]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-solovay-lem2"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-solovay-lem2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-solovay-lem2 — Solovay Counter-Realization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1e36ef17b6856ad1\" href=\"?note=1e36ef17b6856ad1\" title=\"89-lem-solovay-truth\">89-lem-solovay-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4505fdbef0375a48\" href=\"?note=4505fdbef0375a48\" title=\"89-df-generated-submodel\">89-df-generated-submodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ce064881a79d6f7\" href=\"?note=0ce064881a79d6f7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-soundness\">89-df-arithmetical-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span> 为有限 GL 模型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\not\\models A\">\\(M,w\\not\\models A\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 为标准可证明性实现集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；所取生成子模型只依赖本条的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,w)\">\\((M,w)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}lem2}\\vdash\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}lem2}\\vdash\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 9 章，印刷页 124–130；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 生成的子模型并把根重编号为 1，新增前置根 0，然后使用自指 Solovay 构造。真值引理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash S_1\\to\\neg\\tau(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash S_1\\to\\neg\\tau(A)\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\tau(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\tau(A)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\neg S_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\neg S_1\\)</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0R&#39;1\">\\(0R&#39;1\\)</span>，PA 又证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Bew}[\\neg S_1]\">\\(S_0\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Bew}[\\neg S_1]\\)</span>；但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models S_0\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models S_0\\)</span>，且假设的实际证明使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Bew}[\\neg S_1]\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Bew}[\\neg S_1]\\)</span>，矛盾。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-lem-solovay-truth","status":"resolved","id":"1e36ef17b6856ad1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-generated-submodel","status":"resolved","id":"4505fdbef0375a48","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-generated-submodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"M,w\\not\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"(M,w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}lem2}\\vdash\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau(A)).","display":true},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash S_1\\to\\neg\\tau(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\tau(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\neg S_1","display":false},{"tex":"0R'1","display":false},{"tex":"S_0\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Bew}[\\neg S_1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\models S_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Bew}[\\neg S_1]","display":false}],"bytes":1369,"backlinks":[{"id":"189150f03c9cdc63","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 9 章，印刷页 124–130；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n此处按原书使用 PA 的标准模型可靠性。原文在证明新增根节点的极限句为真、反解释不可证时使用“PA 所证都真”；仅排除爆炸的一致性不能替代这一步的来源依据。该条件并未被宣称为所有理论推广或其他证明的